#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.4.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: October 19, 2023"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:6
msgid "**4.4.2 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:13
msgid "Message Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:15
msgid "Added ``Language.invalidMessageFormat`` error message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:18
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Database Migrations:** The ``-g`` option for the ``spark "
"migrate:rollback`` command was removed. It did not work from the "
"beginning. Also, the rollback command returns the database(s) state to a "
"specified batch number and cannot specify only a specific database group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Security:** The presence of the CSRF token is now also checked in the "
"raw body (not JSON format) for PUT, PATCH, and DELETE type of requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:27
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Filters:** The Auto-Discovery for Filters and "
"``Filters::discoverFilters()`` is deprecated. Use :ref:`registrars` "
"instead. See :ref:`modules-filters` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:32
msgid ""
"**CLI:** The public property ``CLI::$readline_support`` and "
"``CLI::$wait_msg`` are deprecated. These methods will be protected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:34
msgid ""
"**CodeIgniter:** The parameter ``$config`` for the ``displayCache()`` "
"method is deprecated. It was not used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:38
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:40
msgid ""
"**CodeIgniter:** Fixed a bug that returned \"200 OK\" response status "
"code when Page Not Found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Spark:** Fixed a bug that caused spark to not display exceptions in the"
" production mode or to display backtrace in json when an exception "
"occurred."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Forge:** Fixed a bug where adding a Primary Key to an existing table "
"was ignored if there were no other Keys added too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Routing:** Fixed a bug that ``spark routes`` may show incorrect route "
"names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.2.rst:48
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

